 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Remember the days when light broke through",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You endured the hard struggle and pain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Publicly exposed to the world's view",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Side by side with the ones in chains",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suffered with the prisoners in the dark",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Accepted the loss of what was yours",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joyfully took the seizure of your mark",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Knowing your treasure is far more secure",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So do not throw away your confidence now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It carries a great reward for your soul",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You need endurance to hold your ground",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until you receive what God foretold",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You had a better and lasting possession",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not things that decay or fade away",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But a hope that stands in its session",
